              "at": 30,
              "text": "Ooh, you're really hungry. You should eat something.",
              "topic": "GREETING",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "clip": "addon:oreville_vn:cyhrkn"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Cooking with Lava",
          "duration": 36,
          "lines": [
            {
              "at": 0,
              "text": "Cooking, are we? You know food goes in raw and comes out cooked? I figured that out myself.",
              "topic": "BLUFF",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "cue": "kitchen_jingle",
              "clip": "addon:oreville_vn:ofvivl"
            },
            {
              "at": 11,
              "text": "Don't touch it!",
              "topic": "PANIC",
              "emotion": "scared",
              "clip": "addon:oreville_vn:ajuuwr"
            },
            {
              "at": 19,
              "text": "You killed the fire! It was so young! It had so many things left to burn!",
              "topic": "ARGUE",
              "emotion": "angry",
              "cue": "price_sting",
              "clip": "addon:oreville_vn:nuowcu"
            },
            {
              "at": 28,
              "text": "Mmm, pork.",
              "topic": "ADMIRE",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "cue": "kitchen_bed",
              "clip": "addon:oreville_vn:abxgfo"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Two Emerald Suppers",
          "duration": 32,
          "lines": [
            {
              "at": 0,
              "text": "Mmm, do I smell cooking? Put me on it! I mean food! Put food on it!",
              "topic": "GOSSIP",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "cue": "kitchen_jingle",
              "clip": "addon:oreville_vn:nvkyms"
            },
            {
              "at": 10,
              "text": "Well, I guess I'm homeless now.",
              "topic": "CHICKEN_OUT",
              "emotion": "sad",
              "clip": "addon:oreville_vn:baervo"
            },
            {
              "at": 19,
              "text": "Be gentle, odd-looking villager! Books do not enjoy being thrown about!",
              "topic": "ARGUE",
              "emotion": "angry",
              "cue": "kitchen_bed",
              "clip": "addon:oreville_vn:abrdcu"
            },
            {
              "at": 27,
              "text": "Ooh! Is it soup time? Please say it's soup time!",
              "topic": "GREETING",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "clip": "addon:oreville_vn:mvhmvc"
            }
          ]
